    "description": "<p>Data here is the input needed for running the 1D EVP model referenced here:</p>\n<p>Rasmussen, T. A. S., Poulsen, J., Ribergaard, M. H., &amp; Rethmeier, S. (2024). dmidk/cice-evp1d: Unit test refactorization of EVP solver CICE (refactorevp1d_v0.1). EGU V. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10782548.</p>\n<p>This is based on a restart on the 2020030100 from the NAAg domain.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ponsoni Leandro, Ribergaard Mads Hvid, Nielsen-Englyst Pia, Wulf Tore, Buus-Hinkler J&oslash;rgen, Kreiner Matilde Brandt, Rasmussen Till Andreas Soya; Greenlandic sea ice products with a focus on an updated operational forecast system; Frontiers in Marine Science, Volume 10,2023;10.3389/fmars.2023.979782 &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
